        {
          "row": 3,
          "column": 2,
          "source_cell": "Executing/Servicing Party system checks if this instruction is a new occurrence or not. \nIt also checks if this instruction is already handled or not.\nIf validation of the message fails, a status message “REJECTED” will be sent including the related errors and reason information.\nIf the message is valid and the time permits the creation of the object, the data will be processed and a status message “COMPLETED” will be sent.\nOtherwise a status message “QUEUED” will be sent and the instruction will be resubmit to validation after a specific event."
        }
